%% Offline submission state machine — the customer-visible lifecycle
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Draft
  Draft --> Queued: tap Submit
  Queued --> Submitting: worker send
  Submitting --> Queued: offline / 5xx / timeout (backoff + jitter)
  Submitting --> NeedsAttention: permanent 4xx or attempts exhausted
  Submitting --> Accepted: 200/201 + reference
  Accepted --> MediaPending: photographs remain
  MediaPending --> Complete: all confirmed
  Accepted --> Complete: no photographs
  NeedsAttention --> Queued: customer corrects
  Complete --> [*]

  note right of Accepted
    Only now is the claim
    "Submitted". Before this it is
    "Saved on this device" or
    "Waiting to send".
  end note
